            "review_title": "Review at Casa MiKa",
            "review_text": "Escape55926089339\n1 contribution\n0\nDisappointed with the service\nSep 2026 • Friends\nDid not like the service\n\nUnfortunately, the impressions from visiting Casa MiKa were not the most pleasant. The main drawback for us was the service. The staff was not attentive enough and not very interested in the guests. Some requests required repeated attention, and the service in general was quite slow.\n\nI would like a more polite, attentive, and professional attitude towards guests. For a restaurant of this level, the quality of service plays a very important role. I hope the management will pay attention to this point and improve the service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 11, 2026",
